WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:30.620
Every time I look up to the sky after the rain

3
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.130
I think back to when I was a crybaby

4
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:43.870
I was chasing somebody's back blindly

5
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.850
Thinking "I want to be stronger"

6
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:52.030
The word "thank you" has faded into the wind now

7
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.210
Am I getting stronger?

8
00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:02.880
I don't know the answer yet

9
00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:08.400
That's why I'll keep walking ahead

10
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.030
So let's go

11
00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:14.240
Without stopping

12
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:19.480
Without giving up to the flow of time

13
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:25.090
I'll keep getting back up

14
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:30.730
Because I don't want to lose something precious

15
00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:35.850
The voice inside of me

16
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:41.250
keeps sustaining me

17
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:46.380
Wicked rain will get in my way

18
00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:51.320
But I won't walk away

19
00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.780
So let's go

20
00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:00.060
Without stopping

21
00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:05.350
Without giving up to the flow of time

22
00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:10.990
I'll keep getting back up

23
00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:16.350
Because I don't want to lose something precious

24
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:22.050
To the future I believe in...

25
00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:40.030
<b>The War's Conclusion</b>

26
00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:44.500
You've gotta be kidding me! What kind of doctor carries a sword around?!

27
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.950
Do you make house calls by submarine or something?!

28
00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.350
What's wrong? Who is it?!

29
00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.920
Trafalgar Law...

30
00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.730
A rookie from the North Blue!

31
00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.000
What?!

32
00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.530
If I'm remembering right, he's a pirate who teamed up with Straw Hat Luffy and got away...

33
00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.630
after the Celestial Dragon incident on the Sabaody Archipelago the other day!

34
00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.500
It looks like they've come to save him in their submarine!

35
00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.850
Don't waste any more time! Hand him over!

36
00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.400
That's why I'm asking you who the hell you are and why I should trust you!

37
00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.250
Captain Law! Warships are approaching off the stern!

38
00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:29.720
Hurry! Bring both of them over here!

39
00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.990
Calling all Navy soldiers!

40
00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:36.120
Split into two forces:

41
00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:40.050
push back the Whitebeard Pirates' attack,
 and suppress the Blackbeard Pirates' ambush!

42
00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.420
Marines are coming up from underground!

43
00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.680
They had a path down there?!

44
00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.590
We've got backup! All right! Take them out immediately!

45
00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.790
W-What?!

46
00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.000
What is this?!

47
00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.430
What an extraordinary power!

48
00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.470
I said I'll never let him escape!

49
00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:47.940
You're not going anywhere!

50
00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:56.710
He's putting on a pretty fantastic show, once again.

51
00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.680
But I can't control it too well yet.

52
00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:06.050
Hey, Captain! If you get too carried away, we'll lose our footing as well!

53
00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:10.670
What do you think, Sengoku the Buddha?! Garp the Hero?!

54
00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.960
Can you stop me?!

55
00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:17.630
Your era ended with Whitebeard's!

56
00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.550
What's Blackbeard doing now?!

57
00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.140
I'm scared!

58
00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.920
I've got a bad feeling about this!

59
00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:39.490
Warning! Due to the earthquake that struck Marineford...

60
00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:44.370
we are issuing a tsunami warning for the south coast of Sabaody Archipelago.

61
00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:49.110
We assure you there is no cause for panic, please remain calm.

62
00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:57.970
Please take shelter in the elevated areas of Groves 40 to 50, on the northern side of the archipelago.

63
00:05:57.970 --> 00:05:59.960
Get out of the way! What are you waiting for?!

64
00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.340
I'm a noble! I'll pay you, just let me go first!

65
00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.820
Everyone, please remain calm.

66
00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:19.910
The Pacifista have crossed the chasm in the plaza!

67
00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:27.300
Follow the Pacifista! Don't let the pirates escape, men!

68
00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:31.770
Hey!

69
00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.470
What's wrong with you?!

70
00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:42.440
I don't know! But I'm so sad!

71
00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.680
Sad?

72
00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.930
I can hear voices in my head...

73
00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:01.060
disappearing, one by one...

74
00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.140
What? Voices?

75
00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.320
We'll show you Navy justice!

76
00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.890
Is this your idea of justice?!

77
00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.490
That's for my friend who died in the war!

78
00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:26.420
Damn pirate! Go to Hell!

79
00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:35.420
Now it's time to make them understand! The rulers of the sea are not the pirates, but us!

80
00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.250
I did it!

81
00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.800
What kind of nonsense are you spouting?!

82
00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:41.100
Have you gone crazy? Get a hold of yourself!

83
00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.960
H-Help me...

84
00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:45.170
Run!

85
00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.580
Koby!

86
00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.450
Hey! Where are you going?!

87
00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.160
As many of us must escape as possible!

88
00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.670
Hang in there! You can still be saved!

89
00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:04.680
We must get him treated!

90
00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.610
I... I don't want to die...

91
00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:09.570
Abandon him! We're at war here!

92
00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:10.990
B-But Sir...

93
00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:15.460
This is the time to show the power of the Navy... of justice!

94
00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.470
We have no time to tend to the wounded!

95
00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.200
Go!

96
00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.380
Y-Yes Sir!

97
00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:23.390
Chase down the pirates!

98
00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.130
Kill every last one of them!

99
00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.520
Someone, help him! Anyone!

100
00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.820
Destroy the pirates! Don't leave a single one alive!

101
00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:40.700
The killing won't stop... The marines have accomplished their goals, but are far more brutal now!

102
00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.390
Our bullets don't work!

103
00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:49.800
Chase them!

104
00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.160
Damn villains!

105
00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:56.620
Something is wrong... with our "justice" and "evil"...

106
00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.020
Both sides are acting in their own self-interests.

107
00:08:59.020 --> 00:08:59.760
Damn it!

108
00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:04.210
Listen up, men! As long as you are marines...

109
00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.690
you must never forgive the evil we know as pirates!

110
00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.620
Nobody can stop me!

111
00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.770
I'll destroy everything and swallow it up!

112
00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.780
Just leave Straw Hat Luffy behind.

113
00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:34.880
That's...

114
00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.170
It's Kizaru!

115
00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.730
Hurry and get them over here!

116
00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:41.390
All right, I'll leave them with you, whoever you are!

117
00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:44.390
Do what you can!

118
00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.290
Catch them, Jean Bart!

119
00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.950
All right! Good job!

120
00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.600
Let's dive!

121
00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:55.940
You did well to escape from me on Sabaody, Trafalgar Law...

122
00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.650
He's horribly injured! Is he still alive?

123
00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.310
Let's hurry!

124
00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.760
Damn it!

125
00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.350
Just give it up!

126
00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:08.760
That's enough!

127
00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.030
A marine?

128
00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:28.820
Koby!

129
00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:36.210
Stop, already! All this fighting, just end it!

130
00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.830
What's with him?

131
00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.920
S-Someone...

132
00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.220
H-Help us...

133
00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.020
We're throwing people's lives away!

134
00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:54.250
Even though every single soldier has a family waiting for them to return!

135
00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.450
Even though we've already accomplished our goal!

136
00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:02.930
We keep chasing pirates who don't want to fight, drawing out a battle that should already be over...

137
00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.680
and abandoning soldiers who could be saved if we treat their wounds now!

138
00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:10.650
And still, we're sacrificing even more people!

139
00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:14.120
What about the soldiers who will fall after this?!

140
00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.220
Koby?!

141
00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:21.170
We're making them look like idiots!

142
00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:24.000
Huh? Who the hell are you?!

143
00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:33.870
You've wasted several seconds of my time. The Navy has no use for soldiers who aren't righteous!

144
00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.800
It's hopeless... I'm gonna die!

145
00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.410
But... I said it! I said what I wanted to say!

146
00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:44.190
I have no regrets!

147
00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.470
You did well, young marine.

148
00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:08.580
You risked your life to create a brief moment of courage...

149
00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:14.840
for better or worse, that has greatly changed the fate of the world.

150
00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.720
Hurry! Hurry and bring him inside!

151
00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:17.580
Yes, Captain!

152
00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.860
That's not gonna work.

153
00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:25.870
Don't do anything, Kizaru.

154
00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:29.630
Oh, my... Benn Beckman...

155
00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.250
That's... that ship is...

156
00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.680
Cast off!

157
00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.260
What is...

158
00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:39.430
one of the Four Emperors of the New World doing here?!

159
00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:42.020
It's Red Hair Shanks!

160
00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:56.830
I've come...

161
00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.730
to end this war!

162
00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.370
Red Hair...

163
00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:26.780
The one who put Luffy on the path to become a pirate!

164
00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:46.350
It's the Red Hair Pirates!

165
00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.410
No way!

166
00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:57.880
The skirmish between Emperors Kaido and Red Hair was just a few days ago in the New World!

167
00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:01.350
He made it all the way here already?!

168
00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.650
Sh-Shanks?!

169
00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:09.260
W-What are you doing here?!

170
00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.590
Buggy!

171
00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:14.490
Y-Your straw hat?

172
00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.120
Give it to Luffy.

173
00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.370
Why do I have to do that?!

174
00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:22.500
I had a treasure map I wanted to give you, too...

175
00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.410
Really?!

176
00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:26.550
Yeah. It leads to a great treasure trove!

177
00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.020
Oh, come on!

178
00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:32.650
That's way too good to be true! You think you can fool me with a story like that?

179
00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:36.040
All right. I'll just give it to someone else, then.

180
00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.540
Wha-?! Oh, crap, wait! I'll do it!

181
00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:40.380
I'll give it to him right away!

182
00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.390
Chief!

183
00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.610
You haven't seen Luffy for ten years!

184
00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.270
Don't you want to take a look at him?

185
00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.340
Yeah...

186
00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:00.380
Captain! This is dangerous!

187
00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:03.680
I know it's rare to see one of the Four Emperors, but hurry and close the doors!

188
00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.100
Sure.

189
00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:08.920
You forgot this! Here, catch!

190
00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.870
Something's flying towards us.

191
00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.060
This is...

192
00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:19.190
Captain! Hurry! Hurry up!

193
00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.750
Sure!

194
00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.950
I would like to see him, but...

195
00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.190
I'm entrusting you with this hat.

196
00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:48.350
Make sure you give it back one day...

197
00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:51.450
once you've become a great pirate.

198
00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.130
That's a promise, Luffy.

199
00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.950
If we met now...

200
00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.520
it would break our promise, wouldn't it...

201
00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.120
Luffy?

202
00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:31.880
This should be a fun operation.

203
00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.960
Red Hair, you scum!

204
00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.970
You let Dragon's son escape!

205
00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:45.230
Ice Age!

206
00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:52.790
He's after the submarine!

207
00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:54.420
The water is freezing over!

208
00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.900
His pulse is starting to stabilize.

209
00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.100
What now?

210
00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:11.310
This is an emergency! The ice is closing in on us!

211
00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.840
We'll dive quickly!

212
00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.720
Looks like we got away...

213
00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.030
W-We're safe...

214
00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.430
Yasakani Sacred Jewel!

215
00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:54.080
W-What is it now?!

216
00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:59.490
We've got to go deeper! To the ocean floor!

217
00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:04.590
We'll get hit! We're definitely gonna get hit!

218
00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.600
Hurry! Full speed ahead!

219
00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:22.810
Damn it... They just won't give up!

220
00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.930
He didn't hit them, did he?

221
00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.850
Ace's brother! Jinbe!

222
00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:31.690
If they're still alive now...

223
00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:35.590
then they're really lucky.

224
00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:39.730
We'll just have to give up on them for now...

225
00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:52.450
Why is that warship sailing out alone?

226
00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.580
You must hurry!

227
00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.600
Follow the submarine!

228
00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.950
Follow it? But it's at the bottom of the ocean!

229
00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:03.250
I doubt it even survived the Admirals' attacks just now...

230
00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:06.290
No. They are, without a doubt, alive.

231
00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:09.960
Listen well!

232
00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.600
As one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea,

233
00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.740
I shall definitely chase down Straw Hat Luffy and finish him off!

234
00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.810
Report this to the Navy!

235
00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.170
Y-Yes Ma'am!

236
00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:23.190
B-But where should we go?

237
00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:24.940
Just advance!

238
00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:29.110
She's crazy, yet so beautiful!

239
00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.850
What did you say?!

240
00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:38.790
You were lying about the treasure map?!

241
00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:41.220
D-D-Damn you!

242
00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.930
It was a spur of the moment thing, Buggy.

243
00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.630
It's been a long time, huh?

244
00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:49.290
W-What do you mean

245
00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.290
"It's been a long time, huh?"

246
00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:57.830
Don't forget that I still hold a grudge against you, Shanks!

247
00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.230
About what?

248
00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.440
Don't tell me you've forgotten!

249
00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:05.650
If you hadn't shouted at me back then,

250
00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:13.520
I wouldn't have lost that treasure map, nor would I have Devil Fruit powers!

251
00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.280
Oh, that's what you meant?

252
00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:21.630
Thanks for the great reaction.

253
00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:26.100
I've always hated this side of you!

254
00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:31.050
As soon as we were reunited you took advantage of me!

255
00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:34.240
I don't care if you've come to end this war, or whatever...

256
00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:38.650
I'm ready to start a one-on-one war with you right now!

257
00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:41.610
Did you see that?

258
00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:42.650
I saw it!

259
00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.930
He's talking to Red Hair Shanks, one of the Four Emperors...

260
00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.560
with that attitude!

261
00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.930
Captain Buggy!

262
00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.530
We will follow you...

263
00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:58.230
forever!

264
00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:01.270
All right, I got it. Don't get upset.

265
00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.520
What was that?!

266
00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:08.670
But wait a second...

267
00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:14.050
as long as I'm with these guys, I can get off this island safely!

268
00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:21.860
Red Hair...

269
00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.330
Marco.

270
00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.610
Don't continue this fight any longer.

271
00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:30.570
Just pull back quietly.

272
00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.290
Hawk-Eye!

273
00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.550
Where are you going?!

274
00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:43.320
I agreed to fight Whitebeard...

275
00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:46.260
Fighting Red Hair was not part of the agreement.

276
00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:50.110
I'm leaving.

277
00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:55.020
If you keep on fighting...

278
00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:01.860
both sides will suffer more pointless casualties.

279
00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:06.870
If anybody still wants to fight...

280
00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:16.990
then come! We will be your opponents!

281
00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:38.230
What do you say, Teach?

282
00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:40.730
No, Blackbeard!

283
00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:44.870
Let's stop for now.

284
00:22:44.870 --> 00:22:47.930
I got what I wanted.

285
00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:52.280
It's still too soon for us to fight you guys.

286
00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:55.000
Let's go, men!

287
00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:37.190
Everyone...

288
00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:41.900
for now...

289
00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:47.310
please listen to what I have to say.

290
00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:32.460
Here's the final news report...

291
00:24:33.330 --> 00:24:36.050
Whitebeard. Ace.

292
00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:40.160
Please leave their burial to us.

293
00:24:42.740 --> 00:24:46.760
This war was broadcast all over the world.

294
00:24:46.760 --> 00:24:52.930
Don't exploit their deaths more than you already have!

295
00:24:52.930 --> 00:24:54.510
What selfish crap are you spouting?!

296
00:24:54.510 --> 00:24:59.350
Holding their heads up to the world will be the symbol of our victory!

297
00:24:59.350 --> 00:25:01.440
The Vice Admiral is right!

298
00:25:01.440 --> 00:25:03.650
Are you trying to disgrace our victory?!

299
00:25:03.650 --> 00:25:05.910
We won't obey the orders of a pirate!

300
00:25:05.910 --> 00:25:07.320
Very well.

301
00:25:08.930 --> 00:25:10.620
Fleet Admiral!

302
00:25:14.440 --> 00:25:18.190
I'm fine with entrusting them to you, Red Hair.

303
00:25:18.190 --> 00:25:19.440
But, Sir!

304
00:25:20.030 --> 00:25:22.550
I will take the blame.

305
00:25:25.610 --> 00:25:26.840
Sorry about this.

306
00:25:27.260 --> 00:25:29.670
Tend to the wounds of the fallen!

307
00:25:36.750 --> 00:25:38.950
This war...

308
00:25:38.950 --> 00:25:42.290
is over!

309
00:25:48.790 --> 00:25:51.600
Everyone who can move, help the medical staff!

310
00:25:51.600 --> 00:25:54.160
Start with the ones who are heavily injured!

311
00:25:54.160 --> 00:25:58.370
We can't suffer any more casualties on this battlefield!

312
00:25:59.930 --> 00:26:01.170
And so...

313
00:26:01.700 --> 00:26:06.410
the greatest battle since the curtain first rose on the Great Age of Pirates...

314
00:26:06.650 --> 00:26:11.380
the great war of Marineford, came to an end.

315
00:26:11.380 --> 00:26:14.600
Engraving its place in history.
